<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Bố cục trang web với DIV và CSS</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f1f1f1;
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* 1. THANH ĐIỀU HƯỚNG TRÊN CÙNG (NAVBAR) */
        .navbar {
            background-color: #222222;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 20px;
            height: 50px;
        }

        .nav-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .nav-logo {
            color: #9d9d9d;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 16px;
            padding: 0 15px;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .nav-links li {
            height: 100%;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100%;
            padding: 0 15px;
            color: #9d9d9d;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* Mục active (Home) */
        .nav-links a.active {
            background-color: #080808;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .nav-login a {
            color: #9d9d9d;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        .nav-login a:hover {
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* 2. KHU VỰC THÂN TRANG (3 CỘT) */
        .main-container {
            display: flex;
            flex: 1;
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Cột bên trái */
        .sidebar-left {
            width: 18%;
            background-color: #f1f1f1;
            padding: 20px 15px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .sidebar-left a {
            color: #337ab7;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .sidebar-left a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Cột nội dung chính giữa */
        .content-center {
            width: 62%;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-left: 1px solid #e7e7e7;
            border-right: 1px solid #e7e7e7;
        }

        .content-center h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .content-center h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .content-center p {
            line-height: 1.5;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: #333333;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .content-center hr {
            border: 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        /* Cột bên phải (quảng cáo ADS) */
        .sidebar-right {
            width: 20%;
            background-color: #f1f1f1;
            padding: 20px 15px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .ad-box {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e3e3e3;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 25px 10px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #333;
        }

        /* 3. CHÂN TRANG (FOOTER) */
        .footer {
            background-color: #555555;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- 1. HEADER / NAVBAR -->
    <div class="navbar">
        <div class="nav-left">
            <a href="#" class="nav-logo">Logo</a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#" class="active">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Projects</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-login">
            <a href="#">➜] Login</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. THÂN TRANG 3 CỘT -->
    <div class="main-container">
        <!-- Cột trái chứa các Link -->
        <div class="sidebar-left">
            <a href="#">Link</a>
            <a href="#">Link</a>
            <a href="#">Link</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Cột giữa chứa nội dung bài viết -->
        <div class="content-center">
            <h1>Welcome</h1>
            <p>
                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. 
                Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. 
                Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum consectetur adipiscing elit, 
                sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.
            </p>
            
            <hr>

            <h3>Test</h3>
            <p>Lorem ipsum...</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Cột phải chứa các khối ADS -->
        <div class="sidebar-right">
            <div class="ad-box">ADS</div>
            <div class="ad-box">ADS</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. FOOTER -->
    <div class="footer">
        Footer Text
    </div>

</body>
</html>
